{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/b1cd2ce22fbeb018f7dc6c95fd260251.webp?t=1753201033\" width=600 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fog has invaded the peaceful Frog Kingdom, corrupting its inhabitants and turning them into wild, hostile creatures. As one of the last guardians of the frog order, it is up to you to fight this mysterious force and restore balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Autobattler strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/c918c9fb555da0a60c002529a2bf7937.poster.avif?t=1753201033\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/c918c9fb555da0a60c002529a2bf7937.webm?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/c918c9fb555da0a60c002529a2bf7937.mp4?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your troops skilfully in intense battles, use their strengths and adapt your strategy to the enemy formations. Let the frogs fight for themselves as you rethink and adapt the course of the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tame your rivals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/f9902debb20759aec116c27900765273.poster.avif?t=1753201033\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/f9902debb20759aec116c27900765273.webm?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/f9902debb20759aec116c27900765273.mp4?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat corrupted frogs in strategic battles and win them for your team. Each new member brings unique skills and characteristics that will have a decisive influence on the course of your adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/83ba62f62f6181182413d8edeb6735c5.poster.avif?t=1753201033\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/83ba62f62f6181182413d8edeb6735c5.webm?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/extras/83ba62f62f6181182413d8edeb6735c5.mp4?t=1753201033\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen and develop your frogs to form the strongest squad in the kingdom. Experiment with different combinations and discover synergies between the abilities of your companions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hopfall comes with:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 unique frog heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ tamable frogs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ combat encounters, including 3 bosses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 biomes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456640?t=1753201033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3456640?t=1753201033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456640/2a4827e8